{"type":"message","id":"4693276e","parentId":"38e84a23","timestamp":"2026-04-13T13:48:09.827Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Summarizing with clarity**\n\nI need to create a concise summary that includes information on preliminary findings, but I have to be careful not to label anything as a diagnosis. It’s important to make that distinction clear so that there’s no misunderstanding about the information I’m presenting. This will help keep everything accurate and focused on what’s known without jumping to conclusions. Let's ensure everything is clear and straightforward!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_00f817b97194c8740169dcf416eb8c8191924f3c0307a3cc42\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp3PQYgDi1YAh0jfHwZmxC1xa6mE_ls53JTugQ9CTT7VLjam_ceWakJlUze40sFMeYIcidKAzBQot1TunNyvDKNCtl-pCANj5oBnmlKv5QwPqkTTBKoZuUdAMLMOr2NPElSGnDBxmmLaFse5piihjhHYoXeWLytrde-Cxe9Td6tI3qHGXf_fVQgvhR3Fcmzg08_jdj8dnJuN_poi3_MOgayD6nNGkQ3k0tsqodcOJXsz3XJuNdwVDH6Uvbf7bbLuJNEOpvIGDmOEQuzOiidiI8J50XROoox08pDzUHsvHbrYyJ5RLNpYFGaioYyk-m1vflzCg7OHlJhKpDSI_HqmT1_DwigswCijEU2Xzxe8LdoO1NB7ZMtXFDQ3I3L1ftuHXqAzzRA1EU1Nz3rXl-5mGD7DdYbz_Tsr9FaSIgc8xdcYHQzELmKd1vJJMvy67ZlXaNwOjz0Qg8S6BNLLo2K2UEJALYB8OWGHmyVlZe-xpnuWZpjaffX2nPjSxXod-Yp5Cpnyyv5oTMW3d1YjRxKEhdPhzu0ENtyaesBrBPq5sIJoM_5A6_GKk4RriUAiZAw4OF1vyjSZfDUWiQI5k6BRCGSpwYg7DOY-Vj6MkUmRGDW7DmFvKLLrSePu4poCJkMZnY59he2FIeJw2oY4p2EU_46bwJeF9JCUDj_0euVd8ymgOfgO_n1pFE7FKBgOz73fxvIT7SkyXiV3a0aMhKa-lR0mqku7aRu44zAGW9XcRJckM2dwbirSy_jMiLLGkp-C7ronhc3vW0woKp2syQx1VoTmUmhQEdj8J5bciASlNAT-XlU7X5NQPcnGr5B_p0wPE5qVx9kT4MKOB0TYAFStWD3relTa_94bpKpsr_s9xZC7CIBtohH6UGmEUMNvPUr0mZlm-x\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Summarizing with clarity**\\n\\nI need to create a concise summary that includes information on preliminary findings, but I have to be careful not to label anything as a diagnosis. It’s important to make that distinction clear so that there’s no misunderstanding about the inform