d the remainder part or if it can be removed. It's probably a good idea to edit the script function. I think I’ll add exact constants for paths and include a helper function for extracting selected fields. It might be useful to include tracking for path strings since the user asked to encode based on the actual track. Let's make sure to implement these changes.\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_mTTloxL7m5qJ08wI5DEJFi20|fc_00f817b97194c8740169dd150bc00c81918a99ff774f343fce","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"~/.openclaw/skills/depression-pipeline/scripts/pipeline_execution_tool.py","old_string":"def _extract_module_reference_metrics(response_payload):\n    if not isinstance(response_payload, dict):\n        return None\n\n    voice_depression_detection = _deep_get(\n        response_payload,\n        [\"workflows\", 0, \"branches\", 0, \"nodes\", 0, \"children\", 0, \"tracking\", \"parameters\"],\n        default={},\n    )\n    fuzzy_stress_evaluator = _deep_get(\n        response_payload,\n        [\"workflows\", 0, \"branches\", 0, \"nodes\", 0, \"children\", 0, \"children\", 0, \"tracking\", \"parameters\"],\n        default={},\n    )\n\n    modules = {\n        \"voice_depression_detection\": voice_depression_detection if isinstance(voice_depression_detection, dict) else {},\n        \"fuzzy_stress_evaluator\": fuzzy_stress_evaluator if isinstance(fuzzy_stress_evaluator, dict) else {},\n    }\n    if not any(module for module in modules.values()):\n        return None\n    return modules\n","new_string":"VOICE_DEPRESSION_TRACKING_PARAMETERS_PATH = [\n    \"workflows\", 0, \"branches\", 0, \"nodes\", 0, \"children\", 0, \"tracking\", \"parameters\"\n]\nFUZZY_STRESS_TRACKING_PARAMETERS_PATH = [\n    \"workflows\", 0, \"branches\", 0, \"nodes\", 0, \"children\", 0, \"children\", 0, \"tracking\", \"parameters\"\n]\n\n\ndef _pick_fields(source, field_names):\n    if not isinstance(source, dict):\n        return {}\n    return {field_name: source[field_name] 